cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "eSMAF: Electronic Soil Management Assessment Framework"
message: >-
  If you use eSMAF in work you publish, please cite both the software (this
  file) and the article listed under preferred-citation.
type: software
version: 2.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-04
license: PolyForm-Noncommercial-1.0.0
license-url: "https://github.com/yuri-fpc/eSMAF/blob/main/LICENSE.md"
repository-code: "https://github.com/yuri-fpc/eSMAF"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23965940
abstract: >-
  A desktop implementation of the Soil Management Assessment Framework (SMAF)
  that converts soil measurements into indicator, component and soil health
  index scores. Analytical units are declared rather than inferred, factor
  classes are chosen explicitly, and every analysis records the software
  version, the calculation model, the crop database version, the declared units
  and the factor classes of each site, so that a result can be reproduced and
  any difference between two assessments attributed to a specific decision.
keywords:
  - soil health
  - SMAF
  - soil quality index
  - reproducibility
  - soil science
